{"id":"88afb3e9aa26fa43","group":"27","path":"27/27-df-maxsat.md","title":"Weighted Max Sat in the zero-term convention","display":"df-maxsat — Weighted Max Sat in the zero-term convention","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-df-maxsat","aliases":["27-df-maxsat"],"display":"df-maxsat — Weighted Max Sat in the zero-term convention","depends_on":["[[27-df-boolfunc]]","[[27-df-real]]"],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_pdf_sha256":"1f81062da95a70f9a4f89063cdedaaec08946ffbc117c7345baa7065770cfa1f","source_section":"§2.11.4 Definition 2.12","source_printed_pages":"115,116","source_pdf_pages":"139,140","verification_status":"source-definition-checked-with-local-derivation"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-df-maxsat"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-df-maxsat</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-maxsat — Weighted Max Sat in the zero-term convention"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5d10aed668d85817\" href=\"?note=5d10aed668d85817\" title=\"27-df-boolfunc\">27-df-boolfunc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"dcab93ecb7af658c\" href=\"?note=dcab93ecb7af658c\" title=\"27-df-real\">27-df-real</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_pdf_sha256","html":"1f81062da95a70f9a4f89063cdedaaec08946ffbc117c7345baa7065770cfa1f"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§2.11.4 Definition 2.12"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"115,116"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"139,140"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-definition-checked-with-local-derivation"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n,m\\in\\mathbb N^+\">\\(n,m\\in\\mathbb N^+\\)</span>。对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in[m]\">\\(k\\in[m]\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_k,B_k\\subseteq[n]\">\\(A_k,B_k\\subseteq[n]\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_k\\cap B_k=\\varnothing\">\\(A_k\\cap B_k=\\varnothing\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w=(w_k)_{k\\in[m]}\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}^m\">\\(w=(w_k)_{k\\in[m]}\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}^m\\)</span>。布尔函数空间见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5d10aed668d85817\" href=\"?note=5d10aed668d85817\" title=\"27-df-boolfunc\">27-df-boolfunc</a>，实标量见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"dcab93ecb7af658c\" href=\"?note=dcab93ecb7af658c\" title=\"27-df-real\">27-df-real</a>。项族 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span>、目标函数及最优解集合由下式构造。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"C_k\\coloneqq\\left\\{\\left(a,\\prod_{i\\in A_k}a_i\\prod_{j\\in B_k}(1-a_j)\\right)\\mid a\\in\\mathbb B^n\\right\\}\\quad(k\\in[m]),\\qquad C\\coloneqq(C_k)_{k\\in[m]},\\qquad\\prod_{i\\in\\varnothing}a_i\\coloneqq1.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[C_k\\coloneqq\\left\\{\\left(a,\\prod_{i\\in A_k}a_i\\prod_{j\\in B_k}(1-a_j)\\right)\\mid a\\in\\mathbb B^n\\right\\}\\quad(k\\in[m]),\\qquad C\\coloneqq(C_k)_{k\\in[m]},\\qquad\\prod_{i\\in\\varnothing}a_i\\coloneqq1.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"W_{C,w}(a)\\coloneqq\\sum_{k=1}^m w_k(1-C_k(a))\\quad(a\\in\\mathbb B^n),\\qquad W\\coloneqq W_{C,w},\\qquad W^*\\coloneqq\\max_{a\\in\\mathbb B^n}W(a).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[W_{C,w}(a)\\coloneqq\\sum_{k=1}^m w_k(1-C_k(a))\\quad(a\\in\\mathbb B^n),\\qquad W\\coloneqq W_{C,w},\\qquad W^*\\coloneqq\\max_{a\\in\\mathbb B^n}W(a).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MaxSat}(C,w)\\coloneqq\\{a\\in\\mathbb B^n\\mid W_{C,w}(a)=\\max_{u\\in\\mathbb B^n}W_{C,w}(u)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{MaxSat}(C,w)\\coloneqq\\{a\\in\\mathbb B^n\\mid W_{C,w}(a)=\\max_{u\\in\\mathbb B^n}W_{C,w}(u)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本书按“尽量取消 DNF 项”的零方程约定书写 Max Sat。每项被取消的指示量为 1−C_k；经 De Morgan 对应于通常 CNF 中尽量满足子句的版本。有限非空布尔立方体保证最大值及最优解存在，正权假设将在整数规划等价中保证松弛指标取到全部可得收益。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-boolfunc","status":"resolved","id":"5d10aed668d85817","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-boolfunc]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-real","status":"resolved","id":"dcab93ecb7af658c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-real]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-boolfunc","status":"resolved","id":"5d10aed668d85817","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n,m\\in\\mathbb N^+$。对每个 $k\\in[m]$，$A_k,B_k\\subseteq[n]$ 且 $A_k\\cap B_k=\\varnothing$；$w=(w_k)_{k\\in[m]}\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}^m$。布尔函数空间见 [[27-df-boolfunc]]，实标量见 [[27-df-real]]。项族 $C$、目标函数及最优解集合由下式构造。","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-real","status":"resolved","id":"dcab93ecb7af658c","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n,m\\in\\mathbb N^+$。对每个 $k\\in[m]$，$A_k,B_k\\subseteq[n]$ 且 $A_k\\cap B_k=\\varnothing$；$w=(w_k)_{k\\in[m]}\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}^m$。布尔函数空间见 [[27-df-boolfunc]]，实标量见 [[27-df-real]]。项族 $C$、目标函数及最优解集合由下式构造。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n,m\\in\\mathbb N^+","display":false},{"tex":"k\\in[m]","display":false},{"tex":"A_k,B_k\\subseteq[n]","display":false},{"tex":"A_k\\cap B_k=\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"w=(w_k)_{k\\in[m]}\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}^m","display":false},{"tex":"C","display":false},{"tex":"C_k\\coloneqq\\left\\{\\left(a,\\prod_{i\\in A_k}a_i\\prod_{j\\in B_k}(1-a_j)\\right)\\mid a\\in\\mathbb B^n\\right\\}\\quad(k\\in[m]),\\qquad C\\coloneqq(C_k)_{k\\in[m]},\\qquad\\prod_{i\\in\\varnothing}a_i\\coloneqq1.","display":true},{"tex":"W_{C,w}(a)\\coloneqq\\sum_{k=1}^m w_k(1-C_k(a))\\quad(a\\in\\mathbb B^n),\\qquad W\\coloneqq W_{C,w},\\qquad W^*\\coloneqq\\max_{a\\in\\mathbb B^n}W(a).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MaxSat}(C,w)\\coloneqq\\{a\\in\\mathbb B^n\\mid W_{C,w}(a)=\\max_{u\\in\\mathbb B^n}W_{C,w}(u)\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":1903,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-14","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[27-df-maxsat|df-maxsat — Weighted Max Sat in the zero-term convention]]"},{"id":"874d5c62b2673eb8","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n,m\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}$，$d\\in\\mathbb R_{\\ge1}$；$C_k,A_k,B_k,w_k,W,W^*$ 及其全部输入条件如 [[27-df-maxsat]]，且 $|A_k|+|B_k|\\ge d\\ge1$ 对所有 $k\\in[m]$ 成立。$X$ 在 $\\{0,1\\}^n$ 上均匀分布。"},{"id":"3684631419c30fd9","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$C_k,A_k,B_k,w_k,W,W^*$ 如 [[27-df-maxsat]]，$n,m\\ge1$。连续乘积表达式 $F:[0,1]^n\\to\\mathbb R$ 在下式定义。"},{"id":"c6bd75228eeab645","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n,m\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}$；$C_k,A_k,B_k,w_k,W,W^*$ 及其全部输入条件如 [[27-df-maxsat]]，$d_k=|A_k|+|B_k|\\ge1$。$F:[0,1]^n\\to\\mathbb R$ 在下节构造。$(x^{\\mathrm{LP}},z^{\\mathrm{LP}})$ 是有界线性规划 $\\max\\{\\sum_k w_kz_k\\mid(x,z)\\in[0,1]^n\\times[0,1]^m,\\ \\forall k\\in[m]\\;z_k\\le\\sum_{i\\in A_k}(1-x_i)+\\sum_{j\\in B_k}x_j\\}$ 的最优解，$W^{\\mathrm{LP}}$ 是下节构造的该最优解的目标值。"}],"outgoing":["5d10aed668d85817","dcab93ecb7af658c"]}